00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.836
Film Courage: What is the emotion&nbsp;
manufacturing and distribution industry?

00:00:04.836 --> 00:00:05.200
Andy Guerdat is an American television writer,&nbsp;
producer, instructor, and podcaster: What is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:13.520
that?That's the entertainment business. That's&nbsp;
what we're doing. We're not chasing trends,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:20.160
we're not making trends, we're not doing all&nbsp;
those things that executives and critics and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:26.400
people would like us to think we're doing. We are&nbsp;
trying to make people feel something, whether it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:32.240
movies, television, anything that's the goal.&nbsp;
You're not educating people, you may do those&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:38.120
things in addition to moving people but your job&nbsp;
as a screenwriter (and the screenwriters are the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:43.560
first filmmakers) your job is to make people feel&nbsp;
something. So you're in the emotion manufacturing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:49.120
business and just and the distribution of that&nbsp;
emotion, that's what we do, that's our job.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:55.080
